            "wordWrap": true,
            "borderVisible": true,
            "cornerRadius": 8
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "guideCode",
          "type": "label",
          "text": "let id = setInterval(updateDisplay, 250);\nclearInterval(id);\nlet once = setTimeout(function(message) { print(message); }, 2000, \"done\");\nclearTimeout(once);\n\nTimers are Panel-only. The engine must have a running Qt event loop; a blocking JS callback also delays other timers, UART RX polling and TestRunner.",
